# 部署脚本与配置在 Linux 裸机上执行，强制 LF，避免 Windows 克隆后被转成 CRLF 而跑不起来
*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.env.example text eol=lf

*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf

# 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
